  "title": "review: F2b: land the F2 Claude-dispatch requeue commit on the fixed base",
  "spec": "Respec of T-1377: its commit 3ca4b7e (branch task/T-1377) was built on goal/T-1375 at e953e54, where main was red from PR 28's committed pool.toml (fixed by PR 29, ffae658); its own tests passed, the gate failed on the unrelated baseline. goal/T-1375 now points at ffae658. Cherry-pick 3ca4b7e onto this task branch, run the gate, commit. Change code only if the cherry-pick conflicts or the gate is red on the new base; keep the T-1377 design exactly (bus_read T-1377: _exhausted requeues with hold_note claude_capacity when no account has headroom or running Claude workers reach max_parallel_claude_workers; policy holds unchanged).",
  "inputs": [
    "T-1380"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_executor.py::test_routed_claude_row_requeues_without_headroom",
    "tests/test_executor.py::test_claude_dispatch_requeues_at_worker_cap",
    "tests/test_executor.py::test_complexity_nine_fallback_still_held",
    "tests/test_executor.py::test_claude_dispatch_below_cap_dispatches",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/<this task> exits 0"
  ],
  "scope": [
